The-how-to-get-holy-water-using-Unidentified-potions-Spoiler

1.nymphs almost always carry pink potions which are object detection potions
so, get as many pink potions as you want.
2.don't drink pink potions, leave them unidentified. It seems that identified
potions cannot be changed by this method.
3.collect other suspect potions, ie ill-effect ones, also unidentified and
make a potion pile
4.zap the potion pile with a wand of cancellation
5.Take clear potions and convert them on lawful alters for holy water
6.Take clear potions and convert them on chaotic alters for unholy water

i suggests nymphs because they are quite numerous and always(almost) carry
pink potions, and you can attract them by quaffing fountains. Blank scrolls
also work with this method, but i can't say for sure if identified scrolls
will become blank when cancelled...anyway identified scrolls can always be
made blank with water,holy water potions and,fountains.


